== Competition public window (diagnostic)

We re-scored the frozen CSV with the official scorer. It reproduces the recorded public result exactly (Table III). The method improves on every official baseline under spellF1 and also under macroF1, Cohen's $kappa$ and transition F1. It predicts #w5.poss possessions against 17 in the GT: #N.public_transitions.matched GT transitions are matched, #N.public_transitions.missed are missed and #N.public_transitions.spurious are spurious. @fig:timeline shows the cause. The long possessions are recovered with boundaries within a few frames, but several brief Barcelona/Athletic exchanges between minutes 10 and 12 are absorbed into longer spells. The same pattern appears in the confusion matrix (@fig:confusion): live-ball team errors are rare (#pct(168 / 3454) of H frames, #pct(31 / 2577) of A frames), while #pct(414 / 1469) of dead-ball frames are labelled live. That is consistent with dead stretches being detected late or shortened.

